# Graphify bootstrap

- At start of the first task in a session, run `bash scripts/setup-graphify.sh --check --cli-only`.
- For codebase questions, first run `graphify query "<question>"` when `graphify-out/graph.json` exists.
- Never commit `graphify-out/*` in feature PRs — follow the canonical graphify rules in `AGENTS.md` (do not duplicate them here).
